# EPAS clusters read by MULTI-SOURCE mode (scripts/central/*).
# Copy to config/sources.conf on the central server (it is in .gitignore).
#
# One cluster per line, fields separated by spaces:
#   CODE   HOST   PORT   DATABASE   [USER]
#
# CODE      3-5 characters, A-Z and 0-9 (e.g. PRD01). It becomes the ID prefix in the
#           feeds ("PRD01:app_read"). NEVER change a code once it is live: SailPoint would
#           see every account of that cluster as removed and re-added.
# DATABASE  the cluster's "sailpoint" database (see sql/setup).
# USER      optional; defaults to PGUSER in central.env.
#
# Each cluster needs the one-time setup (sql/setup), a pg_hba.conf line for the
# central server, a ~/.pgpass line, and the views (scripts/central/apply_views_all.sh).

# CODE   HOST                    PORT   DATABASE    USER
PRD01    pgprd01.example.com     5444   sailpoint
PRD02    pgprd02.example.com     5444   sailpoint
# UAT01  pguat01.example.com     5444   sailpoint   sailpoint_feed_uat
